Sliding window with a set of characters currently in the window. Move `right` forward, add the char; if it's already in the set, shrink from `left` until it's gone. Track the max window size. O(n) time, O(min(n, alphabet)) space.

```js
function longestUniqueRun(s) {
  const seen = new Set();
  let left = 0, best = 0;
  for (let right = 0; right < s.length; right++) {
    while (seen.has(s[right])) {
      seen.delete(s[left++]);
    }
    seen.add(s[right]);
    best = Math.max(best, right - left + 1);
  }
  return best;
}
```

Empty string returns 0 since the loop never runs.
